{"id": "De25T3MxX_s", "title": "Video by therishikatha", "description": "Ram fought 14,000 demons. ALONE ⚔️ And Valmiki says it took about 72 minutes | Ramayan Part 5 of 12\n\n🌿 In Panchavati, a demoness named Surpanakha saw Ram and wanted him for herself. Ram said: \"I am married. Try my brother.\" Lakshman sent her right back. (Aranya Kanda 17–18)\n🗡️ Furious, she lunged at Sita, and Lakshman cut off her nose and ears.\n👹 She ran screaming to her brother Khara. He sent 14 demons. Ram's arrows finished them. Then Khara came himself, with 14,000. (Aranya 19–23)\n🏹 Ram sent Sita and Lakshman into a cave, and faced them ALONE. His arrows fell like rain. Dushana fell. Trishira fell. And at last, Khara. (Aranya 24–30)\n⏱️ Valmiki says it took one and a half muhurtas: about 72 minutes. (Aranya 30.30)\n❤️ Sita ran out of the cave and hugged him.\n👀 But one demon escaped, and ran to Ravana. (Aranya 31)\n\n➡️ Part 6: Ravana's plan, and a GOLDEN DEER. Follow @therishikatha so you don't miss it!\n\n📚 Rishi Katha picture books tell our gods' stories for kids, in simple words and bright pictures. Insta Family Sale on Books 1–3, till 25 Oct → rishikatha.com (link in bio)\n\n💬 Comment JAI SHRI RAM if you're watching the whole series 🙏\n🔖 Save this, and share it with someone who loves the Ramayan\n\n#ramayan #ramayana #surpanakha #khara #panchavati #shriram #valmikiramayana #jaishriram #sanatandharma #hindumythology #indianmythology #ramayanseries #kidsbooks #rishikatha", "channel": "therishikatha", "uploader_id": "22569163881", "uploader": "Rishi Katha", "timestamp": 1792803492, "like_count": 2091, "comment_count": 23, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1119488080945553a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 51.911, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQNXO7bxuM9_cclPSUHvUrleetZgDi4uFCs9LO-7oOFEOSXq_9KaNzp